## 10. Best-practice prompt stack

A very effective sequencing is:

### Prompt 1: Extract facts
“From this HTML and these image cues, extract only supported facts and likely identity signals.”

### Prompt 2: Research synthesis
“Summarize public web and social presence into a concise creative persona without inventing facts.”

### Prompt 3: Viral positioning
“Convert this persona into a viral short-form viewer hook and emotional tone.”

### Prompt 4: Voiceover writing
“Write the 800-word direct-address cinematic script in present tense.”

### Prompt 5: QC pass
“Remove biography, remove unsupported claims, sharpen hook density, improve memorability.”

